'''Okame's Teahouse (Merciless)''' is the second stage in [[Courts of Agony]]. When clearing this stage, the player is guaranteed to unlock the [[True Form]] of [[Medusa Cat (Rare Cat)|Medusa Cat]], Naga Cat. This is a [[No Continues]] stage.

